  "scope": "Active-Scene Reset boundary: Reset succeeds while a Scene is open when its resource graph permits it, closes the old Scene after the Reset command is queued, and permits a fresh BeginScene/EndScene pair. Rejected Reset retains the guest Scene flag; post-queue state-replay failure may leave the old Scene ended and remains NOTRESET. Full state-block/private-data, window/mode, physical loss, threading, public binding refcounts, native HAL and game/FPS acceptance remain outside this step. S2-42, D3D8 wrapping and stages 4/5/6 remain incomplete.",
